SUMMARY:Wednesday Weekly DJs
DESCRIPTION:Although we are primarily a Live Music Calendar\, we often come across Electronic & DJ events in the area and list them for you as we find out about them. Please verify the DJ\, times and cover charges with the venue. \nOne World Brewing West – 8pm-12am (Latin dance) \nThe One Stop -9pm-12am (until 5/27) \nShakeys Dive Bar – 10pm-2am \nVerify with the venue for the DJs and cover charges. \n 
